  "description": "F3 of the 2026-08-05 tracker-simplification adjudication. Standalone todo-db >= 0.3 has an audited update verb (commit c01cda1) but the project wrapper does not expose it, so corrections happen via drop+recreate (24.6% of native items share a normalised title; 21.2% native drop rate vs 0.2% legacy) or via the unaudited standalone side door (9 update events already appear in the event log). Expose update through _project/scripts/todo with the standalone semantics: one chained audit event with from/to diffs; id, state, and identity immutable. Open item wrapper-update-verb-capability-declaration-handoff is the follow-on (moves update out of standalone_only_commands in the skill sidecar) and depends on this landing.",
